        "y": 389.6,
        "width": 468,
        "height": 48
      },
      "order": 19,
      "parentId": null,
      "text": "As discussed, our proposal includes a comprehensive brand identity package, website redesign, and full suite of marketing collateral. The enclosed statement of work outlines the project timeline, deliverables, and investment summary for your review.",
